# 新空白实验（AsterML v2）

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-blank
schema: 1
title: 新建实验设计
objective: 请在此填写实验目的与主要观察终点
experimental_unit: sample
```

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-main
schema: 1
title: 实验分组
rows:
  - id: g-control
    name: 对照组
    role: control
    condition: 空白或溶媒对照
    independent_n: 3
  - id: g-treatment
    name: 处理组
    role: treatment
    condition: 待设定处理条件
    independent_n: 3
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-main
schema: 1
title: 主检测流程
group_refs: [g-control, g-treatment]
timepoints: [D1]
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-main
schema: 1
format: 96
topology: plate
assay: assay-main
groups:
  g-control: [A1, A2, A3]
  g-treatment: [B1, B2, B3]
roles:
  A1: negative_control
  A2: negative_control
  A3: negative_control
  B1: sample
  B2: sample
  B3: sample
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-01-prepare
schema: 1
execution: executable
title: 01 准备材料与分组布置
assay: assay-main
path: root/prepare
order: 1
blocks:
  - kind: prose
    id: blk-blank-note
    schema: 1
    title: 实验说明
    tone: tip
    body: 在左侧大纲选择步骤，在下方自由插入文本、参数表、示意图、计算器、计时器、检查清单或数据表模块。
  - kind: param_table
    id: blk-blank-params
    schema: 1
    title: 关键设定参数
    rows:
      - key: temp
        label: 环境温度
        value: 25
        unit: Cel
  - kind: checklist
    id: blk-blank-check
    schema: 1
    title: 执行前确认
    items:
      - id: chk-ready
        label: 分组与器材已核对完毕
        blocking: true
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-blank
schema: 1
steps: [step-01-prepare]
```
